      "text": "[9:10 p.m.] #Lekki #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in and out of Lekki is good.\n\n- Freedom Way in and out is good.\n- The Admiralty way in and out is good.\n- Lekki - Ikoyi Link Bridge is good;\n- Durosimi Etti is good.\n- Lekki Toll inwards Lekki 1, Marwa onto Ikate, and Chisco is good.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure smooth traffic flow.\n\n@jidesanwoolu @drobafemihamzat @seunosiyemi_ @lagosMOT1 @followlasg @Sola_Giwa @walemusa",
